   "proposition": "The English points the reader to the Pivoting data chapter with a working cross-reference ([Pivoting data](pivoting.qmd)); the Russian has no link target at all ([Поворот данных] with no destination), so the cross-reference is absent.",
   "reader_consequence": "A Russian reader who does not know pivot_longer() sees literal bracketed text instead of a link and cannot reach the chapter that explains the reshaping step being performed in the next code chunk.",
